{"book":"proverbs","lang":"en2","model":"glm-5.3","timestamp":"2026-08-29T23:27:39.257187300Z","verse":24,"ref":"proverbs 28:24","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":28,"translation":"He who robs his father and his mother and says, “⟨There is⟩ no transgression,” — he is a companion to a man who destroys.","tokens":[{"surface":"גוזל","gloss":"He who robs"},{"surface":"אביו","gloss":"his father"},{"surface":"ואמו","gloss":"and his mother"},{"surface":"ואמר","gloss":"and says"},{"surface":"אין","gloss":"no"},{"surface":"פשע","gloss":"transgression"},{"surface":"חבר","gloss":"a companion"},{"surface":"הוא","gloss":"he is"},{"surface":"לאיש","gloss":"to a man"},{"surface":"משחית","gloss":"who destroys"}]}